    "6": {
      "note": "Dismiss actions bypass target lookup for every published attention kind, require a nonempty itemId and an exactly matching published kind, and return HTTP 202 plus a DismissalIntent carrying the published actionable fingerprint. Missing itemId yields 400, unknown item yields 404 and kind mismatch yields 400. Non-dismiss actions require a target (400 if absent), a known target (404 otherwise) and a published enabled action (409 when absent/disabled); enabled actions return 202. There is no actionable-drift-only missing-target exemption.",
